This licence covers the source code of Rymembra itself.

It does not cover the third-party software Rymembra incorporates: see
THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md, which lists every dependency together with its own
licence text. Notably, the Symphonia audio decoding family is MPL-2.0 and
cpal is Apache-2.0 — neither is MIT, and both carry obligations of their own.

It does not cover the bundled fonts (Geist, Bricolage Grotesque), which are
under the SIL Open Font License 1.1: see apps/desktop/src/font/OFL.txt.

And it does not cover any music Rymembra obtains for you. Every track carries
the licence its source gave it — public domain, a Creative Commons variant,
the Audius Open Music License, or none at all — and Rymembra records that
licence next to the track precisely so that this distinction never gets lost.
See TERMS.md.
